  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">저는 창체동아리로</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">방송댄스반을 올해로 3년차 맡고 있어요</span><br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">작년 저희 학교 축제에 <br>저도 참여해보았답니다.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">총 4곡 공연 중에 <br>저는 2곡을 참여 하였어요.</span><br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">남녀공학이지만</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">방송댄스반에 남자는 저 혼자고</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">다 여학생들뿐입니다.</span><br>&#160;<br><a href=\"https://youtu.be/egTRcMkBh9c\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">https://youtu.be/egTRcMkBh9c</span></a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=egTRcMkBh9c\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"869\" data-video-height=\"489\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/eImvwH/hyTgZsOy5z/AuoHwJQfODLbxQmmjeaU51/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"869\" data-video-origin-height=\"489\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/egTRcMkBh9c\" width=\"869\" height=\"489\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">라리사</span><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><a href=\"https://youtu.be/CKNCAPaQFek\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">https://youtu.be/CKNCAPaQFek</span></a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CKNCAPaQFek\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"869\" data-video-height=\"489\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/tJxJG/hyTgRuMDHt/wH6kLajFJMGdLus2z0EfVk/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"869\" data-video-origin-height=\"489\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/CKNCAPaQFek\" width=\"869\" height=\"489\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">라이언</span><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">제가 어디있을까요??</span><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">올해도 준비중입니다.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">올해는 일단 아이브의 &#39;I AM &#39; 1곡 하고</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">다른 한곡은 아직 뭐할지 안 정했습니다.</span><br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">방송댄스반을 통해 <br>아이브라는 아이돌을 알게 되고 <br>I AM 곡이 이곡이구나 알게 되는;;;;;;;;</span><br>&#160;<br><br><br>&#160;<br>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
